{%- doc -%}
  Kinsoul Energy — Surfaced PDP FAQs (visible, not inside accordion)
  3 highest-friction questions made default-visible on every PDP.
  Schema JSON-LD for these is already emitted by kinsoul-pdp-faq
  (inside the accordion), so we emit ONLY the visible markup here —
  no duplicate structured data.
{%- enddoc -%}

<section class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced" aria-labelledby="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced-heading">
  <div class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__header">
    <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__eyebrow">Before you check out</p>
    <h3 class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__title" id="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced-heading">
      Quick answers
    </h3>
  </div>

  <ul class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__list">
    <li class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__item">
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__q">Are the stones real?</p>
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__a">Yes. All gemstones and pearls are 100% natural — never synthetic, never dyed. Every order includes a certificate of authenticity.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__item">
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__q">Will the elastic stretch out?</p>
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__a">Our cord is tested for tension during inspection and rated for everyday wear. A free replacement cord ships with every order — just in case.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__item">
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__q">Can I wear it in the shower?</p>
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__a">Take it off first. Water, perfume, and lotions can shorten the life of pearls, cord, and silver. Remove before showering, swimming, or applying skincare.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__item">
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__q">What if it doesn't fit?</p>
      <p class="kinsoul-pdp-faq-surfaced__a">Free size exchanges within 30 days. Email hello@kinsoulenergy.com and we'll send a prepaid return label.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
